change_type: instructions+docs   changelog: - Provides Mailchimp account operations through the OOMOL `oo` CLI and the `mailchimp` connector. - Supports audience/list discovery plus fetching individual lists and members. - Adds member management actions for upserting, updating, archiving, and permanent deletion. - Includes tag and merge-field workflows, including listing member tags and updating tag assignments. - Documents safety rules for read, write, and destructive actions, with schema inspection required before running payloads.  Sou

